    new "Está bien. Cumplido aceptado."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I didn't dress for you, [Player.Name]."
    new "No me vestí para ti, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Don't comment on my clothes. It's not your place."
    new "No comentes mi ropa. No te corresponde."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "My wardrobe is not a topic for you. Ever."
    new "Mi guardarropa no es tema para ti. Nunca."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Flattering my clothes won't get you anywhere near what's under them."
    new "Halagar mi ropa no te va a acercar ni un poco a lo que hay debajo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...It's custom. You're not supposed to notice it unless you're close."
    new "...Es hecho por encargo. Se supone que no lo notas a menos que estés cerca."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hm. You noticed. That means you've been paying attention."
    new "Hm. Lo notaste. Eso significa que has estado prestando atención."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "It's custom made. There's only one bottle, and it's mine."
    new "Es hecho por encargo. Solo existe un frasco, y es mío."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Of course it suits me. I had it made for me."
    new "Claro que me queda. Lo mandé hacer para mí."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. Remember it. You'll want to."
    new "Mm. Recuérdalo. Vas a querer hacerlo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "It's rare, like my patience. Enjoy it while you're allowed near it."
    new "Es poco común, como mi paciencia. Disfrútalo mientras se te permita acercarte."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Thank you. It's rare."
    new "Gracias. Es poco común."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Fine. It's nice that you noticed."
    new "Está bien. Qué bueno que lo notaste."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "It isn't for you. Don't flatter yourself."
    new "No es para ti. No te hagas ilusiones."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "You don't get to comment on how I smell, [Player.Name]."
    new "No tienes derecho a comentar cómo huelo, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Is that your idea of a line? Rehearse better ones."
    new "¿Esa es tu idea de una frase para ligar? Ensaya mejores."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Keep your nose, and your opinions, to yourself."
    new "Guárdate tu nariz, y tus opiniones."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...Class? I haven't sat in a classroom in years. But I'll take the thought."
    new "...¿Clase? Hace años que no piso un salón de clases. Pero acepto la intención."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "You're confusing me with someone. Still... thank you, I suppose."
    new "Me estás confundiendo con alguien. Aun así... gracias, supongo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Class? I don't take classes, [Player.Name]. I give them. But thank you."
    new "¿Clase? Yo no tomo clases, [Player.Name]. Las doy. Pero gracias."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Wrong woman, right idea. Everything I do is excellent work."
    new "Mujer equivocada, idea correcta. Todo lo que hago es un trabajo excelente."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Class? The only classroom I sit in now is a boardroom. And yes, I'm the best in it."
    new "¿Clase? El único salón en el que me siento ahora es la sala de juntas. Y sí, soy la mejor ahí."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. I'll take any praise you have. Even misplaced."
    new "Mm. Acepto cualquier elogio que tengas. Aunque esté fuera de lugar."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Class? ...Fine. I'll accept it anyway."
    new "¿Clase? ...Está bien. Lo acepto de todos modos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I don't have classes. But the effort is noted."
    new "No tengo clases. Pero el esfuerzo queda anotado."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Class? I think you have me confused with one of your study partners."
    new "¿Clase? Creo que me confundes con una de tus compañeras de estudio."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I haven't been a student in a very long time. Focus on your own classes."
    new "Hace mucho tiempo que no soy estudiante. Concéntrate en tus propias clases."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mixing me up with some girl from your class? Careful."
    new "¿Me confundes con alguna chica de tu clase? Cuidado."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Worry about your own classes, [Player.Name]. I'll be seeing those grades."
    new "Preocúpate por tus propias clases, [Player.Name]. Voy a ver esas notas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...My grades? That's sweet. Misguided, but sweet."
    new "...¿Mis notas? Qué tierno. Equivocado, pero tierno."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hm. I haven't had grades in years. Nice try, though."
    new "Hm. Hace años que no tengo notas. Buen intento, de todos modos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "My grades? I'm the one who checks yours, remember?"
    new "¿Mis notas? Soy yo la que revisa las tuyas, ¿recuerdas?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mine were always excellent. Let's talk about yours."
    new "Las mías siempre fueron excelentes. Hablemos de las tuyas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Top of every class I ever took. Now match me."
    new "La primera en cada clase que tomé. Ahora iguálame."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Of course they were. Mediocrity is something I fire people for."
    new "Claro que lo eran. La mediocridad es algo por lo que despido gente."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Fine. Thank you. Now show me yours."
    new "Está bien. Gracias. Ahora muéstrame las tuyas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Noted. I expect the same from you."
    new "Anotado. Espero lo mismo de ti."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Deflecting to my grades won't save yours, [Player.Name]."
    new "Desviar el tema a mis notas no va a salvar las tuyas, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Flatter me all you want. I'll still see your grades."
    new "Halágame todo lo que quieras. Igual voy a ver tus notas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Cute deflection. Bring me an A and then we'll talk about grades."
    new "Qué lindo desvío. Tráeme una A y luego hablamos de notas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "You want to talk about grades? Careful, boy. I read yours."
    new "¿Quieres hablar de notas? Cuidado, chico. Yo leí las tuyas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...When were you watching me swim? Don't answer that."
    new "...¿Cuándo me estuviste viendo nadar? No respondas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hm. I didn't know I had an audience."
    new "Hm. No sabía que tenía público."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I do everything well. Swimming is no exception."
    new "Hago todo bien. Nadar no es la excepción."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Thank you. Discipline shows, in the water and everywhere else."
    new "Gracias. La disciplina se nota, en el agua y en todo lo demás."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. Were you watching? Good. I like an audience that pays attention."
    new "Mm. ¿Estabas mirando? Bien. Me gusta un público que presta atención."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Of course. I don't do anything halfway."
    new "Por supuesto. No hago nada a medias."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Thank you. I'll accept that."
    new "Gracias. Lo acepto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hm. I'll let that stand."
    new "Hm. Esa te la acepto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I don't swim for spectators, [Player.Name]."
    new "No nado para espectadores, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Keep your eyes off me in the water. Understood?"
    new "Quítame los ojos de encima en el agua. ¿Entendido?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Watching me in a swimsuit, were you? Choose your next words carefully."
    new "Mirándome en traje de baño, ¿eh? Elige con cuidado tus próximas palabras."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Spare me. I know exactly what you were looking at."
    new "Ahórratelo. Sé exactamente qué estabas mirando."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...I stay in shape. I don't advertise it."
    new "...Me mantengo en forma. No lo ando anunciando."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hm. I don't recall giving you a show."
    new "Hm. No recuerdo haberte dado un espectáculo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I stay in shape. Discipline, [Player.Name]. You should try it."
    new "Me mantengo en forma. Disciplina, [Player.Name]. Deberías probarla."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Strong women run companies. Remember that."
    new "Las mujeres fuertes dirigen empresas. Recuérdalo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. Impressed? Wait until you see what else I can hold down."
    new "Mm. ¿Impresionado? Espera a ver a quién más puedo inmovilizar."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Good. I like it when you notice how strong I am."
    new "Bien. Me gusta cuando notas lo fuerte que soy."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Thank you. I don't need the reminder, but thank you."
    new "Gracias. No necesito que me lo recuerdes, pero gracias."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Fine. Consider it acknowledged."
    new "Está bien. Dalo por recibido."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I don't lift for applause."
    new "No levanto pesas para recibir aplausos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Weights? I have people to carry heavy things for me."
    new "¿Pesas? Tengo gente que carga las cosas pesadas por mí."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Watching me work out? Don't make it strange."
    new "¿Mirándome entrenar? No lo vuelvas raro."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Keep your gym talk for your little friends."
    new "Guárdate tu plática de gimnasio para tus amiguitos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...Only today? I'll forgive the wording this once."
    new "...¿Solo hoy? Te perdonaré la forma de decirlo por esta vez."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hm. You're getting better at this."
    new "Hm. Estás mejorando en esto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Only today? Choose your words more carefully, [Player.Name]."
    new "¿Solo hoy? Elige mejor tus palabras, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Thank you. I'm aware."
    new "Gracias. Lo sé."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. Extra beautiful. Now that's the language I like."
    new "Mm. Especialmente guapa. Ese sí es el lenguaje que me gusta."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Of course I am. And you noticed. Good boy."
    new "Claro que sí. Y lo notaste. Buen chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Thank you. Accepted."
    new "Gracias. Aceptado."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Fine. I'll take it."
    new "Está bien. Lo acepto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Save it. I hear that from better men every day."
    new "Ahórratelo. Escucho eso de hombres mejores todos los días."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Flattery is cheap. You'll have to do better."
    new "Los halagos son baratos. Tendrás que esforzarte más."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Keep your eyes to yourself. I'm your father's wife."
    new "Controla esos ojos. Soy la esposa de tu padre."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Don't. Whatever you're working up to, don't."
    new "No. Sea lo que sea que estés tramando, no."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...Hm. Bold opener. It worked. Don't gloat."
    new "...Hm. Qué apertura tan atrevida. Funcionó. No presumas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...Gorgeous. Well. You're not wrong."
    new "...Guapa. Bueno. No te equivocas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hello, [Player.Name]. And yes. Accurate."
    new "Hola, [Player.Name]. Y sí. Exacto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Gorgeous is accurate. 'Hey there' is beneath you."
    new "Guapa es exacto. 'Hey' no está a tu altura."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. Say it again. Slower."
    new "Mm. Dilo otra vez. Más despacio."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "That's the right word. Use it often."
    new "Esa es la palabra correcta. Úsala seguido."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hello. And thank you."
    new "Hola. Y gracias."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Fine. I'll answer to that."
    new "Está bien. A ese nombre sí respondo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "'Hey there'? I'm not a girl at a bar, [Player.Name]."
    new "¿'Hey'? No soy una chica de bar, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Gorgeous, yes. Yours, no."
    new "Guapa, sí. Tuya, no."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "That's how you address your father's wife? Try again."
    new "¿Así le hablas a la esposa de tu padre? Inténtalo de nuevo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Don't 'hey there' me, boy. I'm not someone you pick up."
    new "No me vengas con 'hey', chico. No soy alguien a quien puedas ligarte."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...Hm. You're not the first to say it. You might be the first to mean it."
    new "...Hm. No eres el primero en decirlo. Quizás seas el primero en decirlo en serio."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...Good. It took years to build. Don't expect a discount."
    new "...Bien. Me tomó años construirla. No esperes descuento."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Confidence is what you call it when you haven't earned it. I've earned mine."
    new "Se le llama confianza cuando no te la has ganado. Yo me gané la mía."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Good. Watch closely. You could use some."
    new "Bien. Observa de cerca. Te vendría bien un poco."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. Then you'll love me when I'm in charge. Which is always."
    new "Mm. Entonces me vas a adorar cuando yo esté al mando. O sea, siempre."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Of course you do. Everyone likes power. Few can handle it."
    new "Claro que sí. A todos les gusta el poder. Pocos pueden manejarlo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Thank you. It's well deserved."
    new "Gracias. Es bien merecida."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Fine. Noted, [Player.Name]."
    new "Está bien. Anotado, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Flattery about my confidence? Transparent."
    new "¿Halagos sobre mi confianza? Demasiado obvio."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I don't need you to like it. I need you to respect it."
    new "No necesito que te guste. Necesito que la respetes."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "You like it? You're not supposed to like it. You're supposed to fear it."
    new "¿Te gusta? No se supone que te guste. Se supone que le temas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Don't mistake my confidence for an invitation."
    new "No confundas mi confianza con una invitación."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...Hm. Only one of?"
    new "...Hm. ¿Solo una de las?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...That's a better compliment than most. Thank you."
    new "...Es un mejor cumplido que la mayoría. Gracias."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "One of? I don't compete for 'one of', [Player.Name]."
    new "¿Una de las? Yo no compito por ser 'una de las', [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Obviously. Smart enough to see through you, too."
    new "Obviamente. Lo bastante lista para ver a través de ti, también."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. Smart enough to run a company and you. Remember that."
    new "Mm. Lo bastante lista para dirigir una empresa y a ti. Recuérdalo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Of course. Intelligence is the only thing I find attractive. Develop some."
    new "Por supuesto. La inteligencia es lo único que me parece atractivo. Desarrolla un poco."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Thank you. It's true."
    new "Gracias. Es cierto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Noted. Accurate, too."
    new "Anotado. Y exacto, además."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Flattering my intelligence? I know that trick. I invented it."
    new "¿Halagando mi inteligencia? Conozco ese truco. Yo lo inventé."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Smart enough to know when I'm being buttered up."
    new "Lo bastante lista para saber cuando me están echando flores."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I'm smart enough to know exactly what you want. The answer is no."
    new "Soy lo bastante lista para saber exactamente lo que quieres. La respuesta es no."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Don't patronize me, boy."
    new "No me trates con condescendencia, chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...Hm. Find your way out, then. Slowly."
    new "...Hm. Encuentra la salida, entonces. Despacio."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...That was a terrible line. And yet."
    new "...Esa frase fue terrible. Y aun así."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Lost? Then I'll lead. I always do."
    new "¿Perdido? Entonces yo te guío. Siempre lo hago."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "A cheap line, but you delivered it well."
    new "Una frase barata, pero la dijiste bien."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Mm. Stay lost. I like you where I can see you."
    new "Mm. Quédate perdido. Me gustas donde te pueda ver."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Good. Now you know where to look when I'm speaking."
    new "Bien. Ahora sabes a dónde mirar cuando hablo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Fine. Accepted."
    new "Está bien. Aceptado."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Fine. I'll let you have that line, [Player.Name]."
    new "Está bien. Te dejo pasar esa frase, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Then find your way out and look somewhere else."
    new "Entonces encuentra la salida y mira hacia otro lado."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Cheap line. Try again when you've grown up a little."
    new "Frase barata. Inténtalo de nuevo cuando hayas crecido un poco."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I've fired men for looking at me the way you are. Remember that next time when you're speaking to me."
    new "He despedido a hombres por mirarme como tú lo haces. Recuérdalo la próxima vez que me hables."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Lost in my eyes? Don't be pathetic."
    new "¿Perdido en mis ojos? No seas patético."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "...You've been paying attention. Interesting."
    new "...Has estado prestando atención. Interesante."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Hm. Discipline shows. I'm glad you noticed."
    new "Hm. La disciplina se nota. Me alegra que lo notaras."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "Discipline, [Player.Name]. You should try it sometime."
    new "Disciplina, [Player.Name]. Deberías probarla alguna vez."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
    old "I work for it. Unlike some people."
    new "Trabajo para lograrlo. A diferencia de algunos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/shion_flirt_lines.rpy:50
